#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:53
msgid "How Connect over Wi-Fi works"
msgstr "通过 Wi-Fi 连接的原理"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:79
msgid ""
"This switches the selected USB phone to a wireless adb connection. The port "
"field starts at 5555. The button stays off when that device is already a Wi-"
"Fi address, an emulator, offline, or not authorized."
msgstr ""
"这会把所选 USB 手机切换为无线 adb 连接。端口字段的初始值是 5555。如果该设备已"
"经是 Wi-Fi 地址、模拟器、离线或未授权，按钮会保持禁用。"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:83
msgid "1. Start from the USB device"
msgstr "1. 从 USB 设备开始"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Unlock the phone, accept this computer's USB debugging prompt, and join the "
"same Wi-Fi network. CoreDeck does not check the network. Nothing runs until "
"you press the button, and every command uses the device selected in the list."
msgstr ""
"解锁手机，接受这台计算机的 USB 调试提示，并加入同一个 Wi-Fi 网络。CoreDeck 不"
"检查网络。按下按钮之前不会执行任何操作，每条命令都使用列表中所选的设备。"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:94
msgid "2. Read the Wi-Fi address"
msgstr "2. 读取 Wi-Fi 地址"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:95
msgid ""
"These run in order. A failed probe is skipped. CoreDeck keeps the first "
"private IPv4 address on a wlan interface: 10.x.x.x, 172.16-31.x.x, or "
"192.168.x.x. The last command is only a bare address, so that address is "
"used when the earlier output is not an interface listing. If no Wi-Fi "
"address is found, CoreDeck stops and leaves the USB connection alone."
msgstr ""
"这些命令按顺序运行。失败的探测会被跳过。CoreDeck 保留 wlan 接口上的第一个私"
"有 IPv4 地址：10.x.x.x、172.16-31.x.x 或 192.168.x.x。最后一条命令只返回一个"
"纯地址；当前面的输出不是接口列表时，就使用该地址。如果找不到 Wi-Fi 地址，"
"CoreDeck 会停止，并保持 USB 连接不变。"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:101
msgid "3. Listen on the TCP port"
msgstr "3. 在 TCP 端口上监听"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:102
msgid ""
"This restarts adbd on the port in the field. The USB debugging session drops "
"while it restarts, so that serial can disappear from the device list. The "
"cable can stay plugged in. The field starts at 5555. If this command fails, "
"CoreDeck does not try to connect."
msgstr ""
"这会在字段中的端口上重启 adbd。重启期间 USB 调试会话会中断，因此该序列号可能"
"从设备列表中消失。数据线可以保持连接。字段的初始值是 5555。如果此命令失败，"
"CoreDeck 不会尝试连接。"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:108
msgid "4. Connect to that address"
msgstr "4. 连接到该地址"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:109
msgid ""
"CoreDeck waits 800 ms, then connects. This command has no -s flag: it talks "
"to the address, not the USB serial. Success is a report containing "
"\"connected to\" or \"already connected\". Anything else waits 600 ms and "
"tries again, up to five times."
msgstr ""
"CoreDeck 等待 800 毫秒后连接。此命令没有 -s 参数：它面向该地址，而不是 USB 序"
"列号。报告中包含“connected to”或“already connected”即为成功。否则会等待 600 "
"毫秒并重试，最多五次。"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:114
msgid "5. Select and save the address"
msgstr "5. 选择并保存地址"

#: /Users/devmuaz/Development/projects/cpp-projects/CoreDeck/src/gui/adb/adb_wifi_help_dialog.cpp:115
msgid ""
"When the connection succeeds, CoreDeck selects <ip>:<port> and saves it in "
"Wireless Devices. You can connect, disconnect, or remove it there later. No "
"further command runs."
msgstr ""
"连接成功后，CoreDeck 会选择 <ip>:<port> 并将其保存在无线设备中。之后可以在那"
"里连接、断开或移除它。不会再运行其他命令。"

